pulse/ holds the PulseAudio client headers, copied unchanged from the Debian
package libpulse-dev 17.0+dfsg1-3 (usr/include/pulse/).

They are part of PulseAudio and licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public
License, version 2.1 or later (LGPL-2.1+); see the notice at the top of each
file. fakepulse.c and the test harness only need them for the API types and
prototypes; no PulseAudio code is linked.
